        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Allow you to** **Download/share images & videos from social apps easily!**  \n\n#### Supported Versions iOS 12 to iOS 18.\n\n### Supported Apps:\n \n- Facebook\n- Flickr\n- Instagram\n- Jodel\n- Likee\n- LinkedIn\n- Messenger\n- MeWe\n- Pinterest\n- Reddit\n- Threads\n- TikTok\n- Tumblr\n- Twitch\n- Twitter (X)\n- VK\n- WhatsApp\n- YouTube\n\n---\n\n**Long press to save/share video and image.**  \n\n1.  Download/share videos and images from all available apps in DLEasy.\n2.  You can know the compatible versions inside tweak settings.\n3.  Import video and audio from YouTube & WhatsApp into Music.app.\n4.  Save media in a custom album as DLEasy.\n5.  You can minimize the download interface and the download will be in the background.\n6.  And much more...\n\n---\n\nSupport Import Audio to Music App for All devices.  \n\n**Configure DLEasy from Settings.**  \n\n##### The tweak is available in Arabic, English, German, Spanish, French, Chinese, Vietnamese, Turkish.\n\n\n##### **If you want DLEasy to support your language, you can do this from** [**here**](https://github.com/AhmedBafkir/Localizable)**.**  \n\n**After you edit the Localizable.strings file manually, please send them to this Email:** [DLEasy@outlook.sa](mailto:DLEasy@outlook.sa).",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
